<div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 border-l-4 border-blue-600 rounded-lg p-5 mb-6 shadow-sm">
  <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
    <i class="fas fa-info-circle text-blue-600 text-xl flex-shrink-0 mt-1"></i>
    <div class="flex-1">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
        ゲストモードで利用中
        <span class="text-xs bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full">無料</span>
      </h3>

      <div class="bg-white/60 rounded-lg p-3 mb-3">
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-2">現在の制限:</p>
        <ul class="text-xs text-gray-600 space-y-1">
          <li>• リスト作成は8件まで</li>
          <li>• データは14日後に自動削除</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <%= link_to guest_sign_up_path,
                  class: "inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 w-full bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-blue-700 transition shadow-sm" do %>
        <i class="fas fa-user-plus"></i>
        <span>今すぐ無料登録して全機能を使う</span>
      <% end %>

      <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 text-center mt-2">
        登録済みのデータはそのまま引き継がれます
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
